    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5787",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nWhat country, friends, is this?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5787/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5787/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 38,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326467,
        "end": 6326535,
        "line": 236146,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@5787",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5859",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nThis is Illyria, lady.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5859/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5859/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 31,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326539,
        "end": 6326600,
        "line": 236151,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@5859",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5924",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nAnd what should I do in Illyria?\nMy brother he is in Elysium.\nPerchance he is not drown’d. What think you, sailors?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5924/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5924/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 39,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5924/line-3",
          "start": 40,
          "end": 68,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@5924/line-4",
          "start": 69,
          "end": 122,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326604,
        "end": 6326766,
        "line": 236156,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@5924",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6090",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nIt is perchance that you yourself were sav’d.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6090/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6090/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326770,
        "end": 6326854,
        "line": 236163,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@6090",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6178",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nO my poor brother! and so perchance may he be.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6178/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6178/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326858,
        "end": 6326941,
        "line": 236168,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@6178",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nTrue, madam; and to comfort you with chance,\nAssure yourself, after our ship did split,\nWhen you, and those poor number sav’d with you,\nHung on our driving boat, I saw your brother,\nMost provident in peril, bind himself,\n(Courage and hope both teaching him the practice)\nTo a strong mast that liv’d upon the sea;\nWhere, like Arion on the dolphin’s back,\nI saw him hold acquaintance with the waves\nSo long as I could see.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-5",
          "start": 145,
          "end": 190,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-6",
          "start": 191,
          "end": 229,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-7",
          "start": 230,
          "end": 279,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-8",
          "start": 280,
          "end": 321,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-9",
          "start": 322,
          "end": 362,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-10",
          "start": 363,
          "end": 405,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6265/line-11",
          "start": 406,
          "end": 429,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6326945,
        "end": 6327449,
        "line": 236173,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@6265",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nFor saying so, there’s gold!\nMine own escape unfoldeth to my hope,\nWhereto thy speech serves for authority,\nThe like of him. Know’st thou this country?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773/line-3",
          "start": 36,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773/line-4",
          "start": 74,
          "end": 114,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6773/line-5",
          "start": 115,
          "end": 158,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327453,
        "end": 6327656,
        "line": 236187,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@6773",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6980",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nAy, madam, well, for I was bred and born\nNot three hours’ travel from this very place.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6980/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6980/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 49,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@6980/line-3",
          "start": 50,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327660,
        "end": 6327790,
        "line": 236195,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@6980",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7114",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nWho governs here?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7114/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7114/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327794,
        "end": 6327848,
        "line": 236201,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@7114",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7172",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nA noble duke, in nature as in name.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7172/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7172/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327852,
        "end": 6327926,
        "line": 236206,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@7172",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7250",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nWhat is his name?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7250/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7250/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327930,
        "end": 6327984,
        "line": 236211,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@7250",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7308",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nOrsino.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7308/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7308/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 16,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6327988,
        "end": 6328034,
        "line": 236216,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@7308",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "CAPTAIN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7358",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nOrsino! I have heard my father name him.\nHe was a bachelor then.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7358/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7358/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7358/line-3",
          "start": 48,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6328038,
        "end": 6328144,
        "line": 236221,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@7358",
        "anchor": "sceneI_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VIOLA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CAPTAIN.\nAnd so is now, or was so very late;\nFor but a month ago I went from hence,\nAnd then ’twas fresh in murmur, (as, you know,\nWhat great ones do, the less will prattle of)\nThat he did seek the love of fair Olivia.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 44,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468/line-3",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 83,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468/line-4",
          "start": 84,
          "end": 130,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneI_36.2/p@7468/line-5",
          "start": 131,
          "end": 176,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
