      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VIOLA.\nO that I served that lady,\nAnd might not be delivered to the world,\nTill I had made mine own occasion mellow,\nWhat my estate is.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
